   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it supports. Merneptah's victory inscription attests a group called Israel in the late-thirteenth-century southern Levant."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it does not. It does not describe the Exodus. Museum overview checked; original report located but protected host prevented direct plate verification."
